<title>TAIWAN: United Micro 1st-half profit down 11 pct.</title>
<headline>United Micro 1st-half profit down 11 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June</p>
<p>	     (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover			    11,536 vs 11,228</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			5,330 vs  6,017</p>
<p>NOTE: United Microelectronics Corp is Taiwan's second largest semiconductor maker.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
